Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:07.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:09.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terry, I know I haven't worked here very long...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:09.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰利，我知道我在这里还没做很久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I was wondering, do you think it would be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我在想可否先…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if I got a $100 advance on my salary?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}预先给我一百元的薪水？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:17.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An advance?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:17.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}预先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so that I can spend Thanksgiving with my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才能跟我家人一起过感恩节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, every year, we go skiing in Vail, and normally my father pays for my ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们每年都会去维尔滑雪场 我爸都会帮我买机票
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I've sort of started this whole independent thing, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由于我已经开始 要求独立…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which is actually why I took this "job."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也因此 我才会来做这个〝工作〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, Rachel, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，瑞秋，亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a terrible, terrible waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个很糟，很糟，很糟的服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really, really awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的，真的很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I hear what you're saying. I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你的意思了 我赞成你的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm trying really hard, and I think I'm doing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是我很努力 而且我觉得自己已经进步了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does anybody need coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人需要咖啡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:59.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN: Yeah, over here. WOMAN: Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:59.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有，这边 - 我要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:06.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E09: The One Where Underdog Gets Away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:06.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第9集：超狗跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.23,0:01:25.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:35.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:39.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:57.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, sir? Hi. You come in here all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:57.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，先生 嗨，你常常来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN: Uh-huh. - I was just wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在想你是否可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you think there's a possibility you could give me an advance on my tips?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有可能先预借给我一点小费
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Okay, okay. That's fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，好，没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry about that spill before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉曾经给你打翻过！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only 98.50 to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只剩九十八块五毛钱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. Hey. ROSS & CHANDLER: Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:15.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：杰夫·葛林斯坦  杰夫·史特劳斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:19.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, did you know that Mom and Dad are going to Puerto Rico for Thanksgiving?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:19.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯 你知道爸跟妈 要去波多黎各过感恩节吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? No, they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？不，不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes, they are. The Blymans invited them. - You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有，布莱曼家邀请他们去的 - 你搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am not wrong. - You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我没错 - 你搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I just talked to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我才跟他们谈过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm calling Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要打给妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, hey. MONICA & CHANDLER: Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this from the Cry for Help Department: Are you wearing makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是求救专线的发问 你脸上有化妆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:54.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As of today, I am officially Joey Tribbiani, actor/model.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:54.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我已是正式的 乔伊·崔比亚尼，演员兼模特儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:03:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's funny, I was thinking you look more like Joey Tribbiani, man/woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:03:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好玩了，我觉得你比较像 乔伊·崔比亚尼，男人兼女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What were you modeling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在当哪种模特儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know those posters for the City Free Clinic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}义诊的海报当平面模特儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow. You're gonna be one of those healthy, healthy, healthy guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你要去扮演 健康男人的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ah? - The asthma guy's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宣传气喘那个人真的很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, he is. RACHEL: Isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对啊 - 可不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know which one you're gonna be? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 知道你要当哪种宣传大使吗  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:19.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I hear Lyme disease is open, so, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:19.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我听说莱姆病有缺人 所以呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck, man. I hope you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好运 希望你能得到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you were right. How can they do this to us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说对了 他们怎么可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是感恩节耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aw. Tell you what. How about if I cook dinner at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样子好了 我在我那边做晚餐好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll make it just like Mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会弄得很像妈妈煮的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you make the mashed potatoes with the lumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会做有颗粒的洋芋泥吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know they're not actually supposed to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本来就不该有…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll work on the lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会设法弄些颗粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Joey, you're going home, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔伊，你要回家去对吧？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I assume, Chandler, you're still boycotting all the Pilgrim holidays?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，你还在抵制 所有清教徒相关的节日？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每一个都不放过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, you're gonna be with your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你会跟你奶奶过？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，还有她男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we're celebrating Thanksgiving in December because he's lunar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我们的感恩节是在十二月 因为他是过农历的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're free Thursday, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么说你星期四有空了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. Oh, can I come? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对，哦，我也可以去吗？ - 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, you still thinking you're gonna make it to Vail?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你要去维尔滑雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely. Shoop, shoop, shoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Only $102 to go. - I thought it was 98.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 只差一百零二块钱  - 不是只剩九十八块五毛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, it was, but I broke a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，嗯，是的 不过我打破了一个杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm off to Carol's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，我要去卡萝家了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, ooh, why don't we invite her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:32.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不也邀她来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, ooh, because she's my ex-wife...
