Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not mine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，不是我的，是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Come in. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 请进 - 谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:06.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Carol borrowed it for a class, and I have to get it back to the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:06.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是卡萝借走的 我得把头还给博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}长什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of like a big face without skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像一张没有脸皮的大脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, heh, I'm familiar with the concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是，这种概念我很熟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We can just look for it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们可以找找看 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, you guys, heh, sure have a lot of books about being a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，你们有很多 当女同性恋的书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know, you have to take a course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，就是得去上个课
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Otherwise they don't let you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然他们就不让人当了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, Yertle the Turtle. A classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，《乌龟耶尔特》 这很经典的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I'm reading it to the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实那本是我念给宝宝听的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The baby that hasn't been born yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没生出来的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, wouldn't that mean you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是否代表你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, you don't think they can hear sounds in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不相信他们在里面 听得到声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:13.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not serious. I mean, you really talk to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:13.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是认真的吧  你真的跟胎儿说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, all the time. I want the baby to know my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，常常 我要宝宝认得我的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you, uh...? Do you talk about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你… 你有提到我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, yeah. All the time. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有，常提 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:29.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, um, we just refer to you as "Bobo the sperm guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:29.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过，我们都是称你为 〝捐精子的泡泡先生〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:45.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, if she's talking to it, I just think I should get some belly time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:45.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她有对胎儿说话，我想 我也要争取一点肚皮时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, not that I believe any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并非我相信这一套
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I believe it. I think the baby can totally hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我信，我想宝宝可以听到 所有的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的？ - 我可以证明给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This will seem a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you put your head inside this turkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过只要你把头 放到这只火鸡里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then we'll all talk, and you'll hear everything we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我们大家都来说话 你就可以听到我们说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:06.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd just like to say I'm totally behind this experiment.
