Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:02.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 我就是〝雅男仕〞香水那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:08.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Aramis? Aramis? Aramis? - Oh.
