Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Get out. JOEY: I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 别开玩笑了 - 我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're amazing. You know when to spritz. You know when to lay back.
