Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:22.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You don't know what that means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:22.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？你不晓得这话对我而言 多么有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm, mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔 唔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You smell great tonight. Uh, what are you wearing?
