Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:51.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's wrong? - I just remembered I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:51.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了？ - 突然想到我另外还有事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:56.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:56.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Whoa. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:06.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（马利欧没告诉你的事…）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（性病：你永远不晓得谁可能染有性病）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess you all saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜大家全都看过了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 看过什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we're just laughing. You know how laughter can be infectious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我们只是在笑，你也知道 笑声是会传染的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Set another place for Thanksgiving. My entire family thinks I have VD.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只好找另一个过节的地方了 整家人都以为我得了性病
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tonight, on a very special Blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今夜的特别节目
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:30.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Mm, looking good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:30.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来不错吃！好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:35.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cider's mulling, turkey's turking, yams are yamming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:35.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}苹果汁在滚、火鸡在烤 山芋香喷喷…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:41.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just not the same without Mom in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:41.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正妈不在厨房 感觉就不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. All right, that's it. Get out of my way and stop annoying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够了，滚出去，别来烦我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's closer. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，这就有点像了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got the ticket, I got the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买到机票了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five hours from now, shoop, shoop, shoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再过五小时 就可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you must stop shooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，你不能再咻下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm gonna get my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我要去收拾行李了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:01.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, will you just come in, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:01.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，你要进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:05.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, thank you. I prefer to keep a safe distance from all this merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:05.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不了，我宁可跟这些快乐的活动 保持安全距离
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look out. Incoming pumpkin pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心！南瓜派来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we all laughed when you did it with the stuffing, but that's not funny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以前来这一套我们都会笑 但这可不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Monica, I got a question. I don't see any Tater Tots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我有一个问题 我没看到薯球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不叫问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my mom always makes them. It's like a tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈都会做，那是传统
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:34.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get a little piece of turkey on your fork, a little cranberry sauce, and a Tot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:34.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又子上面一定要有一片火鸡肉 一点蔓越橘酱再加一颗薯球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it's bad enough I can't be with my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说，由于我的疾病 害我不能跟家人相聚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:42.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because of my disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:42.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经很惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tonight's potatoes will be both mashed with lumps...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚的马铃薯有做成泥的、有颗粒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and in the form of Tots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有做成薯球的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'm off to talk to my unborn child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我要去跟我未出世的孩子谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ah. - Okay, Mom never hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，妈就不会打人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Okay, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，全好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Phoebe, did you whip the pota...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你有把马铃薯打成…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross needs lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯要留一些颗粒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm sorry. Oh, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，我很抱歉，我只有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought we could have them whipped and then add some peas and onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为我们要弄成泥 然后再加进一些豆子和洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:20.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:20.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么要加？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then they'd be just like my mom used to make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我妈死前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是那样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:31.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, three kinds of potatoes coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:31.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，给你们三种不同风味的马铃薯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Goodbye, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，再见了，大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, look at... Sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，天，你们看… 对不起，很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:45.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The most unbelievable thing has happened. Underdog has gotten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:45.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可思议的事件发生了 超狗跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The balloon? - No, no, the actual cartoon character.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 气球超狗？ - 不，不，是真的卡通超狗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course the balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是指气球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's all over the news. Before he reached Macy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新闻全都在报导 在它抵达梅西百货之前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he broke free and was spotted flying over Washington Square Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它松脱了，被人发现 就要飘过华盛顿广场公园上空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:02.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm going to the roof. Who's with me? - Well, I can't. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:02.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我要到屋顶上去看，谁要跟我去？ - 我不行，我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An 80-foot inflatable dog loose over the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一只八十英尺的大狗飘过城市？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:08.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How often does that happen? - Almost never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:08.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这种事能有几回？ - 几乎没机会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Got the keys? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 钥匙拿了吗？ - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any time you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随时可以开始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, where am I talking to here? I mean, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我要对着哪里说？ 我的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there is one way that seems to offer a certain acoustical advantage, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个管道似乎是有听觉上的优势 不过呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just aim for the bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对着隆起的部位就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，开始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I... You know, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？ 我没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is... It's too weird. I feel stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太…太诡异了 我觉得很蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, so don't do it. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系的，那就不要做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to do it just because Susan does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:05.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别因为苏珊这么做 你就非得也来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, baby. Hello, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈罗，宝宝，哈罗，哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That moment when we first saw the giant dog shadow fall over the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们眼看着超狗的影子 往公园坠的那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But did they have to shoot him down? I mean, that was just mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们干嘛非得把它打下来？ 真的很残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:22.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, right about now the turkey should be crispy on the outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:22.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在火鸡应该是外脆…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and juicy on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内多汁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are we standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们干嘛还站在这里？
