Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:43.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I didn't. I asked, "Got the keys?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:43.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我没有 我是问〝钥匙拿了吗？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:47.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. You said, "Got the keys."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:47.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不，不 你是说〝钥匙拿了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Either of you have the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们谁有钥匙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:54.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The oven is on. - Oh, I've gotta get my ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:54.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 炉子还开着 - 我得拿我的机票
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wait. We have a copy of your key. - Well, then get it, get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 等一下，我们有你们的备用钥匙 - 快去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey. That tone won't make me go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种口气也不能让我快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:02.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Joey. - That one will.
