Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:15.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So on a dare, I picked paleontology.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:15.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我就鼓起勇气 挑了古生物学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:21.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you have no idea what I'm saying, because, let's face it, you're a fetus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:21.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你根本不晓得我在说什么 面对现实吧，你只是一个胎儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're just happy you don't have gills anymore.
