Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Ugly Naked Guy's taking his turkey out of the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丑陋的裸男 从烤箱里把他的火鸡拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:00.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY, ROSS & MONICA: Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:00.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Oh, my God. He's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，我的天，他有人陪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugly Naked Guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丑陋的裸男…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is having Thanksgiving dinner with Ugly Naked Gal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟丑陋的裸女 共享感恩大餐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: I gotta see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这我得瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Ugly Naked Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丑陋的裸男，好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:21.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, ugly naked dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:21.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丑陋的裸舞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's nice that he has someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有伴真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shall I carve?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以开始切了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请便
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:40.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:40.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, who wants light cheese and who wants dark cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要白起司 谁要黑起司的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't even wanna know about the dark cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我根本不想问什么叫黑起司
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Does anybody wanna split this with me? - Ooh, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有人要分吃这块吗？ - 我要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. You guys have to make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们得许愿才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:21:01.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Make a wish? - Come on, you know, Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:21:01.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 许愿？ - 得了，你们是知道的，就感恩节啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh. You got the bigger half. What did you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你抢到比较大块的 你刚才许什么愿？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bigger half.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就…要比较大块的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'd like to propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我想举杯庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- A little toast here. Ding, ding, ding. ALL: Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}举杯了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:21.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This isn't exactly the kind of Thanksgiving you planned...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:21.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这也许不是 你们大家想要的感恩节
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:25.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but for me this has been really great, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:25.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是对我来说 今天的感恩节真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think because it didn't involve divorce...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这是因为今天没有人离婚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or projectile vomiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也没有人大吐特吐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just thinking, if you'd gone to Vail...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你去维尔滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:39.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or if you guys had been with your family, or if you didn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:39.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或你们去跟家人相聚 或者要不是你得到…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...syphilis and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅毒或什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we wouldn't be all together, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就不可能在此相聚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess what I'm trying to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我真正想说的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is that I'm very thankful that all of your Thanksgivings sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很感恩 你们大家的感恩节全毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:55.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL & JOEY: That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:55.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太感人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And hey, here's to a lousy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也预祝圣诞节很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a crappy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及更糟的新年佳节
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Hear, hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 干杯 - 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:20.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（有膀胱失控的问题）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.49,0:22:25.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（不要再殴妻）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（痔疮）
